  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 45091f957f709485384a3b4f7718cb75, type: 3}
  m_Name: FinRamassageDechets
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  id: fin_ramassage
  lines:
  - Thank you. The area looks much cleaner already.
  - "The forest can breathe again\u2026 and it feels calmer."
  - With less trash on the ground, animals can come back little by little.
  - "But we\u2019re not finished: picking up is good, but sorting is just as important."
  - "If trash isn\u2019t sorted, it often ends up burned or buried, even when it
    could be recycled."
  - Sorting helps materials get a second life, and it reduces pollution and waste.
  - 'Your next mission: sort all the trash into the correct bins.'
  - When everything is sorted, come back to me.
